    You are [color={$subColor}]a thrall[/color].
    Help your [color={$subColor}]Shadowling[/color] ascend by any means necessary.

shadowling-briefing =
    Shed from this lesser form and start your path to [color={$subColor}]ascension[/color].

thrall-briefing =
    You are [color={$subColor}]no[/color] longer bound to your old beliefs.
    Help your [color={$subColor}]Shadowling[/color] ascend at all costs.

